# D21: (id|author|filename) of every DATABASECHANGELOG row in a JEE-deployed listing viewstore,
# in orderexecuted order. Captured 2026-11-19 from the local cpp-developers-docker postgres
# (database listingviewstore, Liquibase 4.10.0 as run by the JEE deployment), with
#   SELECT id, author, filename FROM databasechangelog ORDER BY orderexecuted
# event-buffer-*/stream_buffer-*/subscription-repository-* rows come from the framework's own
# changelogs; LiquibaseChangelogIdentityTest excludes them. 017-drop-process-event-index.xml has no
# rows: its preconditions use onFail="CONTINUE" and the index does not exist, so it never runs.
# Refresh only from a real JEE viewstore; never edit rows by hand.
